     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Hi,<div><br></div><div>Firstly, big congrats to the release of ggvis 0.1.</div><div><br></div><div>Secondly, I have a question regarding properties in axis. The same question was also mentioned before.</div><div>I used ggvis 0.1 and tried the code presented on the ggvis website <a rel=\"nofollow\">(http://ggvis.rstudio.com/axes-legends.html#custom-styles</a>)</div><div><pre style=\"box-sizing:border-box;white-space:pre-wrap;padding:9.5px;margin-bottom:10px;line-height:1.428571429;color:rgb(51,51,51);word-break:break-all;word-wrap:break-word;background-color:rgb(245,245,245);border:1px solid rgb(204,204,204);border-top-left-radius:4px;border-top-right-radius:4px;border-bottom-right-radius:4px;border-bottom-left-radius:4px\"><code style=\"box-sizing:border-box;font-size:inherit;color:inherit;background-color:transparent;border-top-left-radius:0px;border-top-right-radius:0px;border-bottom-right-radius:0px;border-bottom-left-radius:0px\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">ggvis</span><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(104,118,135)\">(</span><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">mtcars</span>, <span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">props</span><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(104,118,135)\">(</span><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">x</span> <span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(104,118,135)\">=</span> <span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(104,118,135)\">~</span><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">wt</span>, <span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">y</span> <span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(104,118,135)\">=</span> <span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(104,118,135)\">~</span><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">mpg</span><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(104,118,135)\">)</span><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(104,118,135)\">)</span> <span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(104,118,135)\">+</span>\r\n  <span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">mark_symbol</span><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(104,118,135)\">(</span><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(104,118,135)\">)</span> <span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(104,118,135)\">+</span>\r\n  <span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">guide_axis</span><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(104,118,135)\">(</span><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(221,17,68)\">&quot;x&quot;</span>, <span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">properties</span> <span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(104,118,135)\">=</span> <span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">list</span><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(104,118,135)\">(</span>\r\n    <span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">axis</span> <span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(104,118,135)\">=</span> <span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">props</span><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(104,118,135)\">(</span><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">stroke</span> <span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(104,118,135)\">=</span> <span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(221,17,68)\">&quot;red&quot;</span>, <span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">strokeWidth</span> <span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(104,118,135)\">=</span> <span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(0,153,153)\">5</span><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(104,118,135)\">)</span>,\r\n    <span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">grid</span> <span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(104,118,135)\">=</span> <span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">props</span><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(104,118,135)\">(</span><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">stroke</span> <span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(104,118,135)\">=</span> <span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(221,17,68)\">&quot;blue&quot;</span><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(104,118,135)\">)</span>,\r\n    <span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">ticks</span> <span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(104,118,135)\">=</span> <span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">props</span><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(104,118,135)\">(</span><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">stroke</span> <span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(104,118,135)\">=</span> <span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(221,17,68)\">&quot;blue&quot;</span>, <span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">strokeWidth</span> <span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(104,118,135)\">=</span> <span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(0,153,153)\">2</span><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(104,118,135)\">)</span>,\r\n    <span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">labels</span> <span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(104,118,135)\">=</span> <span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">props</span><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(104,118,135)\">(</span><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">angle</span> <span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(104,118,135)\">=</span> <span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(0,153,153)\">45</span>, <span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">align</span> <span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(104,118,135)\">=</span> <span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(221,17,68)\">&quot;left&quot;</span>, <span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">fontSize</span> <span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(104,118,135)\">=</span> <span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(0,153,153)\">20</span><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(104,118,135)\">)</span>\r\n  <span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(104,118,135)\">)</span><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(104,118,135)\">)</span></code></pre></div><div>I am not sure how the properties work on the axis. I thought in the resulting picture, the x axis should be red and ticks on the x axis should be blue. However, it&#39;s not. Do I miss something here? </div><div><br></div><div>Another question, after I make a plot using ggvis, is there any function that allow me to get the javascript (html) code for the plot? It might be helpful for checking the result from R code along with javascript code for vega). </div><div><br></div><div>Thanks.</div><div><br></div></div>"
